Acceptance drivers under accept/ write their progress to logs/*.out and to
structured JSON beside those logs; they were not launched with a shell
redirect of the top-level driver stdout into this file.

This companion exists so tools/validate_ledger.py finds the required
stdout.log path. It does not reconstruct a stream that was never captured.
The driver's actual output, in full, is:

  logs/PROGRESS.md / logs/PROGRESS-epoch2.md
  logs/probe_*.{out,err}, logs/watchdog_null_*.{out,err}, logs/sumreg_*.{out,err}
  logs/mem_headroom_probe.{out,err,json}
  logs/driver_*.{out,err}, logs/*_n15l5-*.{out,err}
  results.jsonl, results_engine.jsonl, summary_regression.json, acceptance.json
